  "description": "With humanity teetering on the brink of extinction—its male population decimated by rampant misandry—the few surviving men have undergone a radical evolution to become the \"Egen-nam.\" Amidst this absolute crisis threatening the very survival of the human race, Kang Dae-geun—an old-school \"Teto-nam\"—finds himself shouldering rights and responsibilities of truly \"state-level\" magnitude, all in service of the sacred mission to ensure the propagation of the human species.\nSource: MU",
